*.pyd

# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash. Without it, `outputs/` also
# matched `src/ez_worker/outputs/` and silently kept that whole source package
# out of the repo — every fresh clone died with
# `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'ez_worker.outputs'`.
/data/
/outputs/
/artifacts/
/checkpoints/

# Third-party source fetched at setup time, deliberately NOT committed.
# PnLCalib is GPL-2.0 (copyleft). Vendoring it into this repository would put
# this project's own source under the same obligation. Keep it fetched, keep the
# boundary explicit, and decide the commercial route before shipping:
# comply, reimplement the published method, or use a permissively licensed model.
/vendor/

share_chat.html
